operations per message bit, and ciphertext expansion factor of
\emph{O}(log \emph{n}). It is also possible to securely encrypt Ω(log
\emph{n}) bits per syndrome under essentially the same assumption on
LWE, which yields a ciphertext expansion factor of \emph{O}(1). (These
measures of complexity are asymptotically the same as those achieved in
{[}PVW07{]}.)
