solving either} SIS\emph{q,m,βor} ISIS\emph{q,m,βon the}

Using analysis techniques of {[}Pei07{]}, the theorem can be generalized
to solve IncIVD\emph{ηϵγ,g}in \emph{any ℓp}norm, 1 \emph{≤p \textless{}
∞}, for an approximation factor \emph{γ}(\emph{n}) = \emph{cp
