We thank Vadim Lyubashevsky for reviewing an earlier draft of this work
and directing us to Klein's paper {[}Kle00{]}, Daniele Micciancio, Phong
Nguyen, and Oded Regev for helpful comments and advice, and Brent Waters
for useful observations about our IBE system. We also thank the STOC
committee and reviewers for many constructive comments, and one
anonymous reviewer in particular for suggesting a closer look at the
role of the Gram-Schmidt vectors in the sampling procedure.

